        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    total_claim_amount = 150000\n    total_settlement_expenses = 30000\n    reinsurance_claim_coverage = 70000\n    reinsurance_expense_coverage = 10000\n    discount_rate = 0.05\n    discount_periods = 1\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    net_claim_liability = total_claim_amount - reinsurance_claim_coverage\n    net_expense_liability = total_settlement_expenses - reinsurance_expense_coverage\n    total_net_liability = net_claim_liability + net_expense_liability\n\n    present_value_reserve = total_net_liability / (\n        (1 + discount_rate) ** discount_periods\n    )\n\n    # Return the reserve rounded to the nearest dollar\n    answer = round(present_value_reserve)\n    return answer\n```",
